WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.309
Hi! I'm Julia. Last Saturday at three p.m., my family wasn't at home. What were they doing?

2
00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.895
My brother Tom is a chef.

3
00:00:12.345 --> 00:00:16.107
At three o'clock, he was cooking at his restaurant.

4
00:00:18.357 --> 00:00:23.372
My sister Ana had a test on Monday, but she wasn't studying.

5
00:00:23.822 --> 00:00:25.819
She was watching TV!

6
00:00:28.069 --> 00:00:30.624
My grandmother was in her kitchen.

7
00:00:31.074 --> 00:00:33.163
She was washing the dishes.

8
00:00:35.413 --> 00:00:38.060
My little cousins were in the park.

9
00:00:38.510 --> 00:00:41.157
They were playing soccer with their friends.

10
00:00:43.407 --> 00:00:47.773
My parents were running on the beach. They love sports!

11
00:00:48.823 --> 00:00:52.538
And Max, our dog? Was he running too?

12
00:00:52.988 --> 00:00:56.982
No, he wasn't. He was sleeping, of course!

13
00:00:59.232 --> 00:01:05.408
And me? I was sitting on a bench in the park. I was waiting for my friend.

14
00:01:05.858 --> 00:01:10.131
And you? What were you doing last Saturday at three p.m.?

